  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "For the reaction, $\\mathbf{X}(s) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathbf{Y}(s)+\\mathbf{Z}(g)$, the plot of $\\ln \\frac{p_{\\mathbf{Z}}}{p^{\\theta}}$ versus $\\frac{10^{4}}{T}$ is given below (in solid line), where $p_{\\mathbf{Z}}$ is the pressure (in bar) of the gas $\\mathbf{Z}$ at temperature $T$ and $p^{\\theta}=1$ bar.<br><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/O3KPX_MwSVyabCGPvfrP2UF_XRyrV8G6SZztjXaUK-4.original.fullsize.png\"><br>(Given, $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}(\\ln K)}{\\mathrm{d}\\left(\\frac{1}{T}\\right)}=-\\frac{\\Delta H^{\\theta}}{R}$, where the equilibrium constant, $K=\\frac{p_{z}}{p^{\\theta}}$ and the gas constant, $\\mathrm{R}=8.314 \\mathrm{~J} \\mathrm{~K}^{-1} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$ )<br><p>The value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;(in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)&nbsp;for the given reaction, at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is ___.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "141.34",
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to graph when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></math><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#916;G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#916;S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>RT</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>lnK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#916;S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#916;S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#916;S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>RlnK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>lnK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#916;S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>166</mn><mo>.28</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>166</mn><mo>.28</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.314</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#916;S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>141</mn><mo>.34</mo></math></p>",
